    h2 Making the Web Accessible @17,212,143,42
    text Strategies, standards, and supporting resources to help you make the Web more accessible to people with disabilities. @17,266,143,142
  row @172,224,481,173
    col @172,224,136,173
      h3 W3C @172,224,136,18
      text The World Wide Web Consortium (W3C) develops international standards for the Web: HTML, CSS, and many more. @172,254,136,143
    col @320,224,160,173
      h3 WAI @320,224,160,18
      text The W3C Web Accessibility Initiative (WAI) develops standards and support materials to help you understand and implement accessibility. @320,254,160,143
    col @492,224,161,173
      h3 You @492,224,161,18
      text You can use W3C WAI resources to make your websites, applications, and other digital creations more accessible and usable to everyone. @492,254,161,143
