    h3 WCAG Evaluation Methodology (WCAG-EM) 2.0 — Note Published @17,1664,395,37
    text (2026-Jul-23) @17,1713,395,21
    text is published as a W3C Group Note. WCAG-EM describes a methodology with a step-by-step process to evaluate how well digital products conform to Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2. WCAG-EM 1 was specifically for testing websites and web pages. WCAG-EM 2 also applies to apps and other digital products. For an introduction to WCAG-EM, see . @17,1746,395,142
    link "WCAG Evaluation Methodology (WCAG-EM) 2.0" https://www.w3.org/TR/wcag-em-2/ @17,1900,395,20
    link "WCAG-EM Overview" /WAI/test-evaluate/conformance/wcag-em/ @17,1932,395,20
