    link "Featured Resource: Making Audio and Video Media Accessible This media resource helps you understand and create captions/subtitles, audio description of visual information, descriptive transcripts, and sign language for media. It introduces user experiences and benefits to organizations. Making Audio and Video Media Accessible" /WAI/media/av/ @424,2109,287,182
